sequenceDiagram
    title UC04 交通订单支付取消退款——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户
    participant P1 as MyOrders.vue
    participant P2 as TrafficOrderController
    participant P3 as TrafficOrderServiceImpl
    participant P4 as TrafficOrderMapper
    participant P5 as NotificationCenterService
    P0->>P1: 选择支付/取消/退款
    P1->>P2: POST /api/order/{orderNo}/动作
    P2->>P3: 校验当前用户与状态
    P3->>P4: 读取并条件更新订单
    P4-->>P3: 返回更新行数
    P3->>P5: 成功后创建通知
    P5->>P3: 通知失败仅记录告警
    P3-->>P2: 返回当前终态
    Note over P0,P5: 仅允许合法状态跃迁；取消和退款的库存回补必须幂等。
